1
00:02:12,626 --> 00:02:14,626


2
00:02:14,650 --> 00:02:16,200
Is this the poisonous rose?

3
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:17,234
Yes.

4
00:02:17,258 --> 00:02:19,270
Because she was pricked by these thorns,

5
00:02:19,294 --> 00:02:22,224
my wife danced frantically for three days and

6
00:02:22,248 --> 00:02:24,320
three nights, and died just as you see.

7
00:02:26,370 --> 00:02:28,200
But aren't there two coffins?

8
00:02:29,425 --> 00:02:30,660
One is my son's.

9
00:02:31,225 --> 00:02:35,233
To cure the dance fever, there is only the Dance-Forgetting Herb from the Three Valleys.

10
00:02:35,375 --> 00:02:38,160
My son went to the Three Valleys to fetch it.

11
00:02:38,419 --> 00:02:38,840
What?

12
00:02:38,865 --> 00:02:39,960
To the Three Valleys?

13
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,600
They say there are three monsters there.

14
00:02:42,735 --> 00:02:43,149
Yes.

15
00:02:43,173 --> 00:02:45,886
He was chased back by a monster at the entrance of the First Valley,

16
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:48,533
and the wounds he received then have flared up again.

17
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,740
Ouch!

18
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:04,120
My, you must be careful with rose thorns.

19
00:03:07,629 --> 00:03:09,080
Good morning, Mother!

20
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,200
My, a gift of roses every morning.

21
00:03:12,414 --> 00:03:13,376
Thank you, Sapphire.

22
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:16,073
I plan to keep this up until your birthday Mother.

23
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:18,026
I wonder what color would be good for tomorrow morning?

24
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,883
A red rose would be lovely.

25
00:03:19,907 --> 00:03:21,219
Certainly!

26
00:03:21,605 --> 00:03:22,840
Watch out!

27
00:03:23,010 --> 00:03:24,160
Don't worry, mom!

28
00:03:29,290 --> 00:03:31,300
My, what an energetic child.

29
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:35,000
Red roses tomorrow, then.

30
00:04:35,045 --> 00:04:36,221
What a beautiful morning.

31
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:38,866
Now, let's pick a rose for Mother.

32
00:05:25,495 --> 00:05:26,980
Go on, Prince Sapphire, touch it.

33
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,660
Touch the thorn of the red rose.

34
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,020
Then you will...

35
00:05:45,945 --> 00:05:46,945
Wait!

36
00:05:48,195 --> 00:05:49,995
Wait!

37
00:05:53,095 --> 00:05:54,995
Wait!

38
00:05:55,230 --> 00:05:56,940
Allow me to pick them this morning.

39
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,560
What is it, Mylon?

40
00:06:05,875 --> 00:06:07,360
Is something the matter?

41
00:06:08,450 --> 00:06:09,960
My body is floating!

42
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:12,940
Curse it!

43
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,940
The Queen was pricked by the thorn instead of the Prince!

44
00:06:16,455 --> 00:06:18,280
What a fast-acting poison!

45
00:06:21,465 --> 00:06:23,520
Someone, someone stop me!

46
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,960
My body is floating!

47
00:06:31,853 --> 00:06:34,540
What does it mean to be pricked by a poisoned rose?

48
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,060
What kind of illness is it, Mother?

49
00:06:41,855 --> 00:06:45,740
Good grief. The target was missed, our expectations ruined—what a complete blunder.

50
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:46,620
What?

51
00:06:46,975 --> 00:06:48,280
She only has three days left?

52
00:06:48,455 --> 00:06:49,940
How tragic!

53
00:06:50,475 --> 00:06:54,168
Suffering from this fever, she may pass away by the third day.

54
00:06:54,192 --> 00:06:55,219
Mother!

55
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,160
Mother!

56
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:02,940
What should I do!

57
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,380
Doctor, what medicine will cure her?

58
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:08,700
There is no choice but to apply the juice of the Dancing Forgetfulness Herb to the wound.

59
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:10,060
Dancing Forgetfulness Herb?

60
00:07:10,350 --> 00:07:11,580
Bring it here at once!

61
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:15,043
Alas, that blooms deep within the mountain valley;

62
00:07:15,067 --> 00:07:17,540
no one who has gone to retrieve it has ever returned.

63
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,160
The mountain valley?

64
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:21,266
You mean the mountain valley where three monsters are said to live?!

65
00:07:21,570 --> 00:07:22,820
That is correct.

66
00:07:23,293 --> 00:07:24,086
This is an order!

67
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,666
Someone, go and get it!

68
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:29,980
How about you?

69
00:07:30,235 --> 00:07:31,689
Well, I'm...

70
00:07:31,713 --> 00:07:32,673
You coward!

71
00:07:32,780 --> 00:07:33,900
Are you scared of monsters?!

72
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,227
No, actually, my wife is sick, so...

73
00:07:36,251 --> 00:07:39,054
No, my wife is sick too...

74
00:07:39,078 --> 00:07:40,900
 I have a wife, too!

75
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,560
Nothing but a bunch of weaklings!

76
00:07:42,855 --> 00:07:43,855
In that case, I will go!

77
00:07:44,239 --> 00:07:45,239
This is fantastic!

78
00:07:45,335 --> 00:07:48,780
Curse that Sapphire, let him go to the mountain valley and get eaten up by those three monsters!

79
00:07:49,285 --> 00:07:49,940
You mustn't!

80
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:53,050
If something were to happen to your health, Your Highness...

81
00:07:53,074 --> 00:07:54,321
Then who will go?

82
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:55,460
Ah, such resolve!

83
00:07:55,970 --> 00:08:00,546
Your Highness, even if it costs me my life, I will surely obtain that medicinal herb and return!

84
00:08:00,815 --> 00:08:05,300
Ah, good grief, young people these days are all good-for-nothings...

85
00:08:13,335 --> 00:08:14,368
I knew it, I'll go after all...

86
00:08:24,905 --> 00:08:26,280
Oh, Tink!

87
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:29,320
You say Her Majesty was pricked by a poisonous rose?

88
00:08:29,415 --> 00:08:30,660
I can't just sit around anymore!

89
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:32,625
Tink, watch over Mother!

90
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,520
Sapphire!

91
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:40,046
What?

92
00:08:40,071 --> 00:08:41,190
Sapphire went alone?

93
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:41,960
This is terrible news!

94
00:08:42,125 --> 00:08:44,400
Nylon, dispatch the army immediately to go with her!

95
00:08:44,545 --> 00:08:46,073
Make sure you choose the strongest ones!

96
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,200
Yes, sir!

97
00:08:50,375 --> 00:08:52,440
Heh, I chose only the weakest ones!

98
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:37,320
Aren't you the town florist?

99
00:09:37,545 --> 00:09:38,960
Why are you in a place like this?

100
00:09:40,530 --> 00:09:45,442
I injured my leg and can no longer walk.

101
00:09:45,466 --> 00:09:46,960
Damn it, were you done in by the monster of the First Valley...?

102
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:52,020
No, my son was attacked, so I came all the way here to avenge him, but...

103
00:09:53,369 --> 00:09:54,602
Sigh, it's impossible with a leg like that.

104
00:09:55,055 --> 00:09:56,440
I will avenge him for you!

105
00:09:57,053 --> 00:09:58,210
Thank you so much.

106
00:09:58,234 --> 00:09:59,779
Please take this.

107
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:00,880
Wait, what are you going to do then?

108
00:10:00,904 --> 00:10:04,349
There was a legend saying that to defeat the monster of the First Valley,

109
00:10:04,373 --> 00:10:07,456
you should fight with water rather than a sword.

110
00:10:12,899 --> 00:10:14,580
Ehehe, it's scary!

111
00:11:08,439 --> 00:11:09,439
You monster!

112
00:11:50,159 --> 00:11:52,360
It's no good, it doesn't even flinch!

113
00:11:59,742 --> 00:12:00,750
It's no good!

114
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,480
It hurts!

115
00:12:08,800 --> 00:12:10,380
You monster!

116
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:21,620
Wait!

117
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:22,420
Wait!

118
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,600
Don't run away!

119
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,000
Don't run away!

120
00:12:32,929 --> 00:12:37,020
To defeat the monster of the First Valley, water works better than a sword.

121
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:39,420
Water!

122
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,540
When I splashed water on it, it started writhing in pain!

123
00:13:15,794 --> 00:13:17,100
A bullet came out from inside its mouth!

124
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:20,700
A whole day has already passed.

125
00:13:21,025 --> 00:13:24,080
Two days left, and two monsters left as well...

126
00:13:24,229 --> 00:13:25,229
I have to hurry...

127
00:13:26,359 --> 00:13:27,359
I'll take this with me!

128
00:13:28,955 --> 00:13:29,928
It'll give me strength!

129
00:13:40,183 --> 00:13:42,214
Sapphire, sapphire...

130
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:47,200
How tragic... You only have 2 days left to live...

131
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:13,120
How strange... It's suddenly gotten so cold...

132
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,153
What huge icicles...

133
00:14:20,119 --> 00:14:22,880
If it weren't for this fire, I'd surely die here...

134
00:14:32,860 --> 00:14:34,286
I'm getting sleepy...

135
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:40,126
I can't fall asleep in a place like this... I still have to fight two more monsters...

136
00:14:47,979 --> 00:14:49,459
What's with this sleepiness...?

137
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:02,204
One and a half days left...

138
00:15:02,228 --> 00:15:05,557
If Sapphire doesn't come back by tomorrow evening... Poor Queen...

139
00:15:05,581 --> 00:15:07,453
Sapphire isn't coming back...

140
00:15:09,369 --> 00:15:11,520
I wonder if Sapphire is in the Second Valley by now?

141
00:15:11,675 --> 00:15:12,462
Or...

142
00:15:14,379 --> 00:15:17,100
Hey, Komadoriku, do you know the Third Valley?

143
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:18,933
Will you guide me there?

144
00:15:19,886 --> 00:15:21,073
Yay!

145
00:15:42,985 --> 00:15:44,400
It's already past noon!

146
00:15:45,609 --> 00:15:47,020
It's the monster of the Second Valley!

147
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,040
Whoa!

148
00:16:24,010 --> 00:16:25,070
Ouch...

149
00:16:29,079 --> 00:16:30,600
Sapphire!

150
00:16:48,206 --> 00:16:49,005
Darn it!

151
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:50,020
I'm trapped! I can't get out!

152
00:16:50,021 --> 00:16:50,420
Ah!

153
00:16:50,810 --> 00:16:52,040
There's my sword over there!

154
00:16:52,929 --> 00:16:53,929
Just a little more!

155
00:17:04,043 --> 00:17:04,863
Sapphire!

156
00:17:09,189 --> 00:17:09,736
Tink!

157
00:17:09,760 --> 00:17:10,300
Give me fire!

158
00:17:10,353 --> 00:17:11,040
Okay!

159
00:17:11,339 --> 00:17:12,339
One, two, go!

160
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:13,599
Thank you!

161
00:17:39,959 --> 00:17:41,646
That's great, Sapphire!

162
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,960
But the monster of the Third Valley is still left!

163
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:44,699
Let's hurry!

164
00:17:46,319 --> 00:17:47,360
What is it, Washi-kun?

165
00:17:48,215 --> 00:17:48,820
Huh?

166
00:17:48,969 --> 00:17:51,219
You're telling me to take this monster's ice fur?

167
00:17:51,324 --> 00:17:53,340
Will taking the ice fur be useful?

168
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,380
Alright!

169
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,680
All right!

170
00:18:01,553 --> 00:18:02,213
It's cold!

171
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:03,380
It's colder than ice!

172
00:18:03,819 --> 00:18:05,900
Into this sword sheath...

173
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,480
Come on, let's go!

174
00:18:09,569 --> 00:18:11,460
Thank you, Washi-san!

175
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:12,820
Thank you!

176
00:18:15,329 --> 00:18:17,740
Komadori-kun, are you guys coming along too?

177
00:18:19,939 --> 00:18:21,720
Now, I wonder what kind of monster the beast of the Third Valley is?

178
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:12,780
It's a dead end!

179
00:19:12,959 --> 00:19:14,440
Something is growing over there!

180
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:16,900
That must be the Forget-to-Dance Herb!

181
00:19:17,306 --> 00:19:19,080
What a pretty flower!

182
00:19:21,089 --> 00:19:23,681
We can't go around this way... that way's no good either!

183
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:25,180
No good!

184
00:19:25,469 --> 00:19:28,853
In that case, we have no choice but to cross this swamp, but...

185
00:19:39,559 --> 00:19:41,800
If you get dragged into this swamp, you won't be able to get out!

186
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:43,580
Huh?

187
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,720
What?

188
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,060
Huh?

189
00:19:46,309 --> 00:19:47,720
You're going to fetch it for us?

190
00:19:48,249 --> 00:19:49,640
We're counting on you, little robins!

191
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:57,320
Woah!

192
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:58,040
It appeared!

193
00:20:24,969 --> 00:20:27,000
So this is the monster of the Third Valley!

194
00:20:29,494 --> 00:20:30,660
Monsters!

195
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,040
Ah!

196
00:20:33,339 --> 00:20:34,540
And it's growing right over there, too!

197
00:20:51,660 --> 00:20:52,660
Tink!

198
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,520
Wah!

199
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:54,800
Help me!

200
00:20:55,009 --> 00:20:56,020
I don't want to!

201
00:20:57,489 --> 00:20:58,840
Give back Tink!

202
00:20:59,100 --> 00:20:59,800
Wah!

203
00:21:00,114 --> 00:21:01,240
Sapphire!

204
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:02,420
Help me!

205
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:03,373
It's icy fur!

206
00:21:03,398 --> 00:21:04,564
Please save us somehow!

207
00:21:18,799 --> 00:21:19,799
It froze!

208
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:24,820
It froze!

209
00:21:25,009 --> 00:21:26,913
The monster has frozen solid!

210
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,080
That's right!

211
00:21:34,354 --> 00:21:36,080
We have to hurry and take those flowers back!

212
00:21:43,169 --> 00:21:44,600
This is more than enough!

213
00:21:44,795 --> 00:21:45,795
Come on, let's go back!

214
00:21:47,420 --> 00:21:47,980
Oh no!

215
00:21:48,365 --> 00:21:49,000
It's the third day!

216
00:21:49,244 --> 00:21:50,860
We have to get back before the sun sets!

217
00:21:59,540 --> 00:22:00,540
It's no use!

218
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:01,600
We won't make it in time!

219
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:02,660
Ah!

220
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,199
I know!

221
00:22:03,224 --> 00:22:05,020
Let's have Komodori-kun carry it!

222
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:05,986
That's right!

223
00:22:06,269 --> 00:22:08,113
I'll squeeze the grass juice and you take it with you!

224
00:22:13,829 --> 00:22:17,100
Apply this to the wound on the Queen's finger!

225
00:22:17,175 --> 00:22:18,175
Do you understand?

226
00:22:20,180 --> 00:22:20,960
I'm counting on you!

227
00:22:21,140 --> 00:22:22,140
Little Robin!

228
00:22:40,689 --> 00:22:41,880
Oh God!

229
00:22:49,620 --> 00:22:50,620
Oh God!

230
00:22:50,655 --> 00:22:51,655
Save us!

231
00:23:07,309 --> 00:23:08,820
What is the matter, everyone?

232
00:23:13,246 --> 00:23:14,300
Really?

233
00:23:14,449 --> 00:23:15,640
What is it, Nylon?

234
00:23:17,029 --> 00:23:18,895
Well, that's certainly a disappointment.

235
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:19,920
No, no...

236
00:23:21,624 --> 00:23:26,080
But wait... does that mean Sapphire managed to get the medicinal herbs safely... Ah!

237
00:23:26,199 --> 00:23:26,840
She's not dead!

238
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:28,020
She's not dead!

239
00:23:28,189 --> 00:23:29,189
Damn it!

240
00:23:32,179 --> 00:23:36,600
It seems Nylon went mad with joy because the Queen came back to life!

241
00:23:59,239 --> 00:24:01,093
Did you make it in time?

242
00:24:01,530 --> 00:24:02,530
Thank goodness!

243
00:24:04,220 --> 00:24:05,220
Mother!

244
00:24:05,244 --> 00:24:07,244

